            "author": {
              "name": "ClaudeDevs",
              "handle": "ClaudeDevs"
            },
            "text": "We're donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation (@AgenticAIFdn), the same foundation we donated MCP to.\n\nSince December 2025, 70+ agent platforms have integrated the standard, including ChatGPT, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, and VS Code. \n\nHere's what that means for you:",
